OL,3,GNEWSAMurder charge after man found shot
OL,4,Adead in car
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been charged with murder
OL,7,Fafter a 42-year-old man was found shot
OL,8,Fdead inside a car in east London.
OL,10,FMasum Miah was discovered fatally
OL,11,Fwounded after police were called to St
OL,12,FBartholomew's Road, East Ham, at about
OL,13,F03:00 BST on 18 August following
OL,14,Freports of gunshots.
OL,16,FThe Metropolitan Police said Sergiu
OL,17,FLeahu, of no fixed address, had been
OL,18,Fcharged with his murder.
OL,20,FThe 40-year-old is due to appear at
OL,21,FBromley Magistrates' Court on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
